        "entities": {
          "urls": [
            {
              "description": "Our move from Rust to TypeScript in the Prisma ORM internals is now in Preview for all first-class databases! In this article, we’re sharing the performance improvements we observed in our latest benchmarks and give an outlook for Prisma v7 where the ORM will become “Rust-free” by default.",
